---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /contact/
active: contact
title: Contact
description: "Concert bookings, teaching and masterclasses, writing and speaking. Contact Adán Fernández directly or through Seven Eight Artists."
---
<section class="page-head split">
  <div class="wrap">
  <div class="head-text">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>Work with Adán.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Concerts, teaching, and writing. The form goes straight to him.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="head-photo"><img src="/assets/img/press/portrait-purple-web.jpg" alt="Portrait of Adán Fernández" width="1369" height="1600" style="object-position:50% 25%" loading="eager"></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Write to him</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <form class="cform" action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Enquiry from adanfernandez site">
        <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table">
        <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false">
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/contact/thanks/">
        <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        <div class="f2">
          <label>Your name<input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></label>
          <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></label>
        </div>
        <label>Organisation or venue<input type="text" name="organisation" autocomplete="organization"></label>
        <label>This is about
          <select name="about">
            <option>A concert or recital</option>
            <option>Conducting or a residency</option>
            <option>Teaching or a masterclass</option>
            <option>Writing or speaking</option>
            <option>Something else</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>Dates, instrument, and anything else that helps<textarea name="message" rows="6" required></textarea></label>
        <button class="btn btn-brass" type="submit">Send</button>
        <p class="fine">Goes straight to Adán at {{ site.email }}. Nothing is stored on this site.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Direct</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <p class="lede">Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass-deep)">{{ site.email }}</a>, or call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass-deep)">{{ site.phone }}</a>.</p>
      <div class="rule-head" style="margin-top:2.4rem"><span class="lbl">Management</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <p class="lede">Represented by <a href="{{ site.management.url }}" rel="noopener" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass-deep)">{{ site.management.name }}</a>. For bookings through management, write to {{ site.management.contact }} at <a href="mailto:{{ site.management.email }}" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass-deep)">{{ site.management.email }}</a>.</p>
      <div class="rule-head" style="margin-top:2.4rem"><span class="lbl">For presenters</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <p>Biographies, photographs, programs, and the one-sheet are on the press kit page.</p>
      <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/press-kit/">Press kit &amp; photos</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
